Installation instructions:

Download the PNG image (zodiacallight_2004.png) that I’ve included in each folder. I’ve organized the folders by number to avoid file name conflicts.
Then, place the zodiacallight_2004.png file in your Stellarium installation directory, depending on where you’ve set that directory—for example:

D:\Stellarium\textures (I’ve placed it on drive D for this example)

Paste it there; this will overwrite Stellarium’s default Zodiacal Light texture.
Restart Stellarium. The default Zodiacal Light texture will now be replaced with the custom texture.
